  "content": "# 虛空維度\n\nSuperflat Dimension 將虛空超平坦世界類型預設添加為一個單獨的維度。\n\n![預覽](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/SrhObyPX/images/07374d42be6bd1d981ca5967a6bc563fc759ec10.png)\n\n## 使用方法\n\n要進入虛空維度，請使用黑曜石製成門框，頂部角放置圓石，底部角放置礫石，以此類推：\n\n![虛空維度傳送門](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47304fa8a5eb166e1b9425fad2899804e42a530b.png)\n\n<details>\n<summary>水平傳送門</summary>\n\n![虛空維度水平傳送門](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0a3de48687dd4f89e97893c9de247375287bf965.png)\n\n</details>\n\n## 兼容性\n\n- [Passengers Portal Fix](https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA)\n- **Create** 擴充套件：[Create: Portal Integration](https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb)\n\n## 問題\n\n目前沒有新的兼容性問題或錯誤報告。請在 [GitHub](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-thevoiddimension/issues) 上報告以便修復。\n\n## 支援\n\n🟩 26.1-26.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2\n\n🟩 已支援  \n🟥 已停止支援  \n🟨 進行中  \n🟪 已考慮  \n\n## 注意\n\n歡迎在模組包、影片、串流媒體或類似媒體中使用此模組。如果喜歡，請財務上支援我，我會非常感謝。<br />\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上看到我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 CurseForge 上可用\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 YouTube 上看我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Discord 上與我交談\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支援我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/oreno\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支援我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://saweria.co/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Saweria 上支援我\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionfixer\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Fixer\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionlink\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Link\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/worldportal\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"World Portal\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vanillaworld\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Vanilla World\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/morecatvariants\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"More Cat Variants\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passengersportalfix\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Passengers Portal Fix\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/createportalintegration\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-createportalintegration/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/createportalintegration/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Create: Portal Integration\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/8SpfTsnq\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-superflatdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/superflatdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Superflat Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/y4wxFDPW\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-amplifieddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/amplifieddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Amplified Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Fo9Xodfg\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-largebiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/largebiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Large Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Y3EdVfom\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-mushroomfieldsdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/mushroomfieldsdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Mushroom Fields Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/ItO3yfpJ\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-beta173dimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/beta173dimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Beta 1.7.3 Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HkbFed4W\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-desertdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/desertdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Desert Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HW5SOOxi\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-badlandsbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/badlandsbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Badlands Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/63pdCQ3Y\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-forestbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/forestbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Forest Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n</p>",
